:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Pedestrians crossing road unexpectedly in heavy rain" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Reduced visibility due to rain and pedestrian spray" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:evidence1 a :FallingObjectIndicator ;
    :description "Rain droplets and pedestrian spray creating visual occlusion" ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.90"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.80"^^xsd:float .
```

